From 0414414a68a60c4ec7377d36a6ef9eb3bb47f1ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReinierTutoriales <86568548+ReinierTutoriales@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:18:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace launcher icon and TV banner with Vireo artwork

The TV Bro license forbids reusing the original app icon in modified binaries. New original flat artwork: a white songbird with a green leaf-shaped wing on a dark blue rounded square. Launcher PNGs for every density are downscaled from art/vireo-icon-master.png; the Android TV banner (640x360, xhdpi) shows the bird with the Vireo wordmark in DejaVu Sans Bold and is kept as art/vireo-banner.png.
---
 .../main/res/drawable-hdpi/ic_launcher.png    | Bin 2900 -> 6550 bytes
 .../main/res/drawable-mdpi/ic_launcher.png    | Bin 1971 -> 3697 bytes
 app/src/main/res/drawable-xhdpi/banner.png    | Bin 23255 -> 26796 bytes
 .../main/res/drawable-xhdpi/ic_launcher.png   | Bin 3835 -> 10092 bytes
 .../main/res/drawable-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.png  | Bin 5904 -> 19404 bytes
 .../main/res/drawable-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.png | Bin 7804 -> 32531 bytes
 art/vireo-banner.png                          | Bin 0 -> 26796 bytes
 art/vireo-icon-master.png                     | Bin 0 -> 780647 bytes
 8 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 art/vireo-banner.png
 create mode 100644 art/vireo-icon-master.png

diff --git a/app/src/main/res/drawable-hdpi/ic_launcher.png b/app/src/main/res/drawable-hdpi/ic_launcher.png
index db7f8633d569c260400798d137cd50be44af0f6f..06788b282c21366fccb8b7dfea2d206f35fa7cd7 100644
GIT binary patch
